 mysterious landscape. YOU decide what you discover next in this world of Fae, Humans and Angels!\n\nThe Angel's mothership, Throne, lays dormant behind a fierce storm. To reach it, unlock its secrets, and usher in the future, you must explore the land of Era and survive its trap-filled ruins, primordial forests, treacherous mountains, mines, and more! Overcome intense battles and hilarious hazards in this tale of betrayal, haunting lore, and fruitless yearning.\n\nFrom Anodyne 2 and Sephonie's devs, Melos and Marina.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/angeline-era", "videos": [{"id": 153111, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "UmzcI3oTU40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UmzcI3oTU40", "title": "Angeline Era- Official Release Window Trailer | Women-Led Games x SGF 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UmzcI3oTU40/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 152683, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5nT2p8nXgrA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5nT2p8nXgrA", "title": "(OLD) Angeline Era Trailer: Bump the World (Demo out now!)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5nT2p8nXgrA/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 156576, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "hVY7hBUoLJE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hVY7hBUoLJE", "title": "Angeline Era | Secret Sauce Showcase trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hVY7hBUoLJE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 156577, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "VbMpJOj8Sl0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VbMpJOj8Sl0", "title": "(OLD) Angeline Era Announcement Trailer - Fast-paced 3D Action RPG with Intense Boss Fights!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VbMpJOj8Sl0/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 168464, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "VU9i_DK2kc4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VU9i_DK2kc4", "title": "Angeline Era Releases December 8 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VU9i_DK2kc4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {